  "extract_html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"ib-wrap\" style=\"width:240px\">\n   \n<aside role=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-darkred pi-layout-default\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"Box title\">Universal Parasitism</h2>\n\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\" data-source=\"image\">\n\t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/b/b5/EldritchPennywise.webp/revision/latest?cb=20260226052328\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"EldritchPennywise\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/b/b5/EldritchPennywise.webp/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/516?cb=20260226052328\" srcset=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/b/b5/EldritchPennywise.webp/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/516?cb=20260226052328 1x, https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/b/b5/EldritchPennywise.webp/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/1032?cb=20260226052328 2x\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" data-relevant=\"1\" alt=\"EldritchPennywise\" width=\"270\" height=\"405\" data-image-key=\"EldritchPennywise.webp\" data-image-name=\"EldritchPennywise.webp\" />\n\t\t\n\t</a>\n\t\n</figure>\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">IT (Stephen King's IT), commonly known as Pennywise the Dancing Clown, is a universal parasite from the \"Macroverse\", which encloses/surrounds and feeds off the regular universe.</h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Row 1 info\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Power/Ability to:</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Be a universal parasite.</div>\n</div>\n</aside>\n</div>\n<p>The power to <b>root oneself into any universe and completely drain its life-force</b>. Advanced variation of <a href=\"/wiki/Planetary_Parasitism\" title=\"Planetary Parasitism\">Planetary Parasitism</a>. Not to be confused with <a href=\"/wiki/Universal_Merging\" title=\"Universal Merging\">Universal Merging</a>.\n</p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Also_Called\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Also Called</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Capabilities\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Capabilities</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Applications\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Applications</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Variations\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Variations</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Associations\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Associations</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Known_Users\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Known Users</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Also_Called\">Also Called</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FUniversal_Parasitism%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D1&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li>Universal Consumption/Devouring/Draining/Eating/Leeching/Vampirism</li>\n<li>Universe Consumption/Devouring/Draining/Eating/Leeching/Parasitism/Vampirism</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Capabilities\">Capabilities</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FUniversal_Parasitism%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D2&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>User can drain the bio-kinetic energies held within entire universes and leave them to wither and fall apart upon departure. This makes it difficult for an opponent to destroy the user, as the users integrates their essence/existence into the survival of the universe they are currently in.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Applications\">Applications</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FUniversal_Parasitism%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D3&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Absolute_Condition\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Absolute Condition\">Absolute Condition</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Environmental_Absorption\" title=\"Environmental Absorption\">Environmental Absorption</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Life-Force_Absorption\" title=\"Life-Force Absorption\">Life-Force Absorption</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Mass_Consciousness\" title=\"Mass Consciousness\">Mass Consciousness</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Organic_Absorption\" title=\"Organic Absorption\">Organic Absorption</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Planetary_Parasitism\" title=\"Planetary Parasitism\">Planetary Parasitism</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Reality_Consumption\" title=\"Reality Consumption\">Reality Consumption</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Reliant_Immortality\" title=\"Reliant Immortality\">Reliant Immortality</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Space-Time_Absorption\" title=\"Space-Time Absorption\">Space-Time Absorption</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Universal_Merging\" title=\"Universal Merging\">Universal Merging</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Universe_Destruction\" title=\"Universe Destruction\">Universe Destruction</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Unimind\" title=\"Unimind\">Unimind</a></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Variations\">Variations</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FUniversal_Parasitism%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D4&amp;uselang