versal Embodiment</a>&#160;- user could spread to many universes.</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Parasite_Physiology\" title=\"Parasite Physiology\">Parasite Physiology</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Reality_Consumption\" title=\"Reality Consumption\">Reality Consumption</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Transcendent_Parasite_Physiology\" title=\"Transcendent Parasite Physiology\">Transcendent Parasite Physiology</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Unity\" title=\"Unity\">Unity</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Universal_Embodiment\" title=\"Universal Embodiment\">Universal Embodiment</a></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Known_Users\">Known Users</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FUniversal_Parasitism%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D6&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li>Obyriths (<i>AD&amp;D</i>)</li>\n<li>Pennywise the Dancing Clown/IT (<i>Stephen King's IT</i>)</li>\n<li>Infovore/Frost Giant (<i>The Atrocity Archive</i>)</li>\n<li>Encroaching Universe Kuiper Belt (<i>Wild Arms</i>)</li></ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260804105409\nCache expiry: 1209600\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.017 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.027 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 117/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 89/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 218/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 4/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip